---
import { siteConfig, externalLinks } from "../../data/site";
---

<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="container-full hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <span class="eyebrow">Product Manager · Since 2011</span>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">
        서비스와 조직을<br />
        <span class="accent-word">구조</span>로 설계합니다.
      </h1>
      <div class="hero-body">
        <p>
          안녕하세요. Product Manager {siteConfig.authorKo}({siteConfig.authorEn})입니다.
          13년째 서비스를 만들고 있습니다. 지금은 우아한형제들에서 배달의민족 주문·배달
          중계 플랫폼의 <span class="marker">PM이자 팀 리더</span>로 일합니다.
        </p>
        <p>
          복잡한 비즈니스를 단순한 구조로 풀어내고, 함께 성장하고 협업할 수 있는 시스템
          기반의 팀을 만드는 일을 가장 좋아합니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="contact-table">
        <div class="contact-row">
          <dt>Email</dt>
          <dd><a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a></dd>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-row">
          <dt>Instagram</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href={externalLinks.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              {siteConfig.instagramHandle} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-row">
          <dt>Brunch</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href={externalLinks.brunch} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              {siteConfig.brunchHandle} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-row">
          <dt>LinkedIn</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href={externalLinks.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              {siteConfig.linkedinName} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-portrait">
      <div class="portrait-frame">
        <div class="portrait-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Olivia</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-9) var(--space-8);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-7);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: var(--fs-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
  }

  .hero-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
    color: var(--color-text-sub);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .hero-body p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact-table {
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .contact-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .contact-row dt {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .contact-row dd {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact-row dd a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .hero-portrait {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .portrait-frame {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 360px;
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  /* Accent corner — bottom right */
  .portrait-frame::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: -8px;
    bottom: -8px;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-right: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
  }

  .portrait-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .home-hero {
      padding-block: var(--space-7) var(--space-6);
    }

    .hero-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-5);
    }

    .hero-portrait {
      order: -1;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .portrait-frame {
      max-width: 240px;
    }

    .hero-body {
      font-size: var(--fs-body);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .contact-row {
      grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-2);
    }
  }
</style>
